  Tag 4.1 / commit dd5641492a71e966b96b8a91398b44bb3df67d88

The Windows client executable is the official 4.1 OpenGL x64 build
(otclient_gl_x64.exe). Lua data, modules, and mods are from the same tag.
See client/LICENSE and client/BUILDINFO.txt.

The official Tibia client, sprites, and related CipSoft assets are not included
and are not part of this project. OTClient may download 13.10 appearance files
into client/data/things/1310/ on first launch if you allow it.
